{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_217_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_217","textTraditional":"一、五年。春王正月辛亥朔，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_217_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_217","textTraditional":"二、夏，歸粟于蔡。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_217_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_217","textTraditional":"孰歸之？諸侯歸之。曷為不言諸侯歸之？離至不可得而序，故言我也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_217_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_217","textTraditional":"三、於越入吳。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_217_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_217","textTraditional":"於越者何？越者何？於越者，未能以其名通也。越者，能以其名通也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_217_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_217","textTraditional":"四、六月丙申，季孫隱如卒。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_217_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_217","textTraditional":"五、秋七月壬子，叔孫不敢卒。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_217_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_217","textTraditional":"六、冬，晉士鞅帥師圍鮮虞。","sentenceOrder":8}],"overrides":{}}